        "cooked": "<p>Bustin makes me feel good</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-315-writers-room-justice-comics-407-408\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-315-writers-room-justice-comics-407-408\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-315-writers-room-justice-comics-407-408\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #315 - Writers' Room: Justice Comics #407-408</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Let's Bust some Bunks!  Show Notes: Run Time: 2:08:17 Oh no, another long one! Well, at least you get a number of villains out of it! And a couple issues! And a bunch of letters answered! So, pretty usual fare.&nbsp; This story certainly didn't land...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/31c03eaa8da2fa0217a9abe051ec57eca9c91bc3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/31c03eaa8da2fa0217a9abe051ec57eca9c91bc3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/31c03eaa8da2fa0217a9abe051ec57eca9c91bc3_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"767hgZIMV0gboCP3mX9MPskgoXp\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/31c03eaa8da2fa0217a9abe051ec57eca9c91bc3_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/31c03eaa8da2fa0217a9abe051ec57eca9c91bc3_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/31c03eaa8da2fa0217a9abe051ec57eca9c91bc3_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"9F8266\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2640×4093 4.46 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
