        "id": 262978,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-04-08T20:18:51.142Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh my <em>god</em>, that cover rocks! That’s so much cooler than I could have expected, hell yes!</p>\n<p>Also, it’s fascinating that this is just a mere 130 issues prior to the previous episode’s issues. I mean, that’s ten years, but still.</p>\n<p>I will do anything for a brownie. c_c</p>\n<p>I can’t believe Christopher made a “Bustin’” reference and I didn’t even think to!</p>\n<p>Oh boy, a silly issue born from a desire to do something serious, my favorite! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Luxembourg doesn’t show up enough in US pop culture. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Missile-genesis is a hell of a power set.</p>\n<p>A CAR THAT TURNS INTO A BUNKER SUIT??? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Okay, between this and the recent Crisis Man story, Bunker is finally a cool hero. I legitimately want that toy, I don’t care if it doesn’t look right! That’s amazing! Where have they been hiding this stuff all this time?</p>\n<p>“Because, of course, as we know, Granite’s name is Stanley Stone.” I gotta tell you, I had to pause the recording and get out of the shower because I was laughing so hard. XD I don’t know why this is so funny!</p>\n<p>He can dance if he wants to, he can leave Fusillade behind.</p>\n<p>Oh awesome, I wondered if the floating one might be Choke! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>…Oh no, does that mean the red and yellow one is Adhesivist??? XD Oh shit, I called it!</p>\n<p>“Famous Bunker line, ‘I can do it.’” I’m dying XD</p>\n<p>Stymie??? This is the episode that keeps on giving!</p>\n<p>Aw yeah, Crisis Man! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Again, I had wondered, the instant they said someone else was watching. God, he is just the worst, I love him.</p>\n<p>Guns and patriotism? Those are my two favorite things to bristle with!</p>\n<p>Aw! He’s just a little guy and it’s his birthday!</p>\n<p>This was fantastic, this episode delivered so much and I’m so pleased to be here right now. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I want a Tachyon vs. Baron Blade story now.</p>\n<p>Tyler Vance driving a car while remote operating a Bunker suit is honestly pretty cool all by itself. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>The Hippo once again revealed to be the hero we deserve.</p>\n<p>I never thought I would hear Christopher say “a little sippy”. Thanks, I hate it.</p>\n<p>Oh no, I hate Dr. Kangaroo more XD</p>\n<p>Bugbear seems far too incurious to end up at the Oracle of Discord. Not exactly a recipe for a good comic story.</p>\n<p>Eating fairies like popcorn! XD</p>\n<p>I literally found the Gambian pouched rat pic of it on a guy’s shoulder right when Christopher said it!</p>",
