        "raw": "Oh my *god*, that cover rocks! That's so much cooler than I could have expected, hell yes!\n\nAlso, it's fascinating that this is just a mere 130 issues prior to the previous episode's issues. I mean, that's ten years, but still.\n\nI will do anything for a brownie. c_c\n\nI can't believe Christopher made a \"Bustin'\" reference and I didn't even think to!\n\nOh boy, a silly issue born from a desire to do something serious, my favorite! :D\n\nLuxembourg doesn't show up enough in US pop culture. :)\n\nMissile-genesis is a hell of a power set.\n\nA CAR THAT TURNS INTO A BUNKER SUIT??? :D :D :D Okay, between this and the recent Crisis Man story, Bunker is finally a cool hero. I legitimately want that toy, I don't care if it doesn't look right! That's amazing! Where have they been hiding this stuff all this time?\n\n\"Because, of course, as we know, Granite's name is Stanley Stone.\" I gotta tell you, I had to pause the recording and get out of the shower because I was laughing so hard. XD I don't know why this is so funny!\n\nHe can dance if he wants to, he can leave Fusillade behind.\n\nOh awesome, I wondered if the floating one might be Choke! :D\n\n...Oh no, does that mean the red and yellow one is Adhesivist??? XD Oh shit, I called it!\n\n\"Famous Bunker line, 'I can do it.'\" I'm dying XD\n\nStymie??? This is the episode that keeps on giving!\n\nAw yeah, Crisis Man! :D Again, I had wondered, the instant they said someone else was watching. God, he is just the worst, I love him.\n\nGuns and patriotism? Those are my two favorite things to bristle with!\n\nAw! He's just a little guy and it's his birthday!\n\nThis was fantastic, this episode delivered so much and I'm so pleased to be here right now. :D\n\nI want a Tachyon vs. Baron Blade story now.\n\nTyler Vance driving a car while remote operating a Bunker suit is honestly pretty cool all by itself. :)\n\nThe Hippo once again revealed to be the hero we deserve.\n\nI never thought I would hear Christopher say \"a little sippy\". Thanks, I hate it.\n\nOh no, I hate Dr. Kangaroo more XD\n\nBugbear seems far too incurious to end up at the Oracle of Discord. Not exactly a recipe for a good comic story.\n\nEating fairies like popcorn! XD\n\nI literally found the Gambian pouched rat pic of it on a guy's shoulder right when Christopher said it!",
