        "cooked": "<p>I’m gonna be honest, I thought the Principle of the Zealot iconic art was a variant of MechaStalin. The red star on his chest and boot (and whatever is going on with his arms) distracted me enough that I legitimately never noticed he was wearing a stars &amp; stripes shirt.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/72a3d7603e43f84afe43fda72c7b3e0b55a6aa2d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/72a3d7603e43f84afe43fda72c7b3e0b55a6aa2d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/72a3d7603e43f84afe43fda72c7b3e0b55a6aa2d_2_654x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gm9swkzq1bl10LMrcJvpYczB1lb\" width=\"654\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/72a3d7603e43f84afe43fda72c7b3e0b55a6aa2d_2_654x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/72a3d7603e43f84afe43fda72c7b3e0b55a6aa2d_2_981x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/72a3d7603e43f84afe43fda72c7b3e0b55a6aa2d_2_1308x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"AD9B7E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1630×1245 190 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
