        "created_at": "2025-04-09T11:23:26.189Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am seeing pictures the Gambian pouched rat with leashes and safety vests. Apparently, they can be trained for search &amp; rescue / contraband detection.</p>\n<p>Some people (including C&amp;A) are misremembering-<br>\nMorris Dugal as the hero Apex was from the alt Freedom Five on that wacky young La Capitan card.<br>\nOf course, I also can imagine inverse Bugbear and Calypso as a hero couple with a super creepy romance/sex/consumption + regeneration thing going on. “it’s consensual and your powers mean there is no lasting harm but please don’t talk about your detailed feelings for your partner”</p>",
