      {
        "id": 265200,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-03-06T17:30:38.537Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Love this cover.</p>\n<p>Fusillade: the French and Indian-Giver.  His power makes a lot of sense to me; I’d want to have him interact with Misfit.</p>\n<p>I was really hoping the villain in the car park was a Bostonian.</p>\n<p>Galt: “When everyone is Bunker, no one will be!”</p>\n<p>If Bugbear tried to eat Haka, I think he should choke.  He wouldn’t infinitely satisfy his unending hunger, it’d just leave him messed up and wrecked for a while.</p>\n<p>Feralis’s affordability index seems pretty close to the Cosmic Contest rankings, aside from the omission of Nightsnake.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2026-03-06T19:43:09.158Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 9,
        "readers_count": 8,
        "score": 1.8,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 31448,
        "topic_slug": "episode-315-of-the-letters-page-writers-room-justice-comics-407-408",
        "display_username": "",
        "primary_group_name": null,
