        "version": 5,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Love this cover.\n\nFusillade: the French and Indian-Giver.  His power makes a lot of sense to me; I'd want to have him interact with Misfit.\n\nI was really hoping the villain in the car park was a Bostonian.\n\nGalt: \"When everyone is Bunker, no one will be!\"\n\nIf Bugbear tried to eat Haka, I think he should choke.  He wouldn't infinitely satisfy his unending hunger, it'd just leave him messed up and wrecked for a while.\n\nFeralis's affordability index seems pretty close to the Cosmic Contest rankings, aside from the omission of Nightsnake.",
